    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d35">

                <pb facs="0108" n="32" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg32"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 863.001F85/13</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Penfield to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-11-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 26, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1551. Department’s 1428. In reply to your message of condolence, which was
                    received on the 25th instant, Minister for Foreign Affairs states: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>I hasten to request your kind intervention in order to express to Mr.
                            Lansing and the Government of the United States my deep-felt thanks for
                            this kind message of condolence.</p>
                        <p>May I also request you to thank Mr. Lansing very warmly on my behalf for
                            his personal sympathy, which I appreciate very deeply.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Burian</hi>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Penfield</hi>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
